# ASTROVITA — optional configuration.
#
# Nothing here is required. With no .env file the observatory queries the
# NASA Exoplanet Archive TAP service directly from the browser and falls back
# to its bundled snapshot if that call fails.
#
# If your deployment's network blocks direct browser calls to the archive
# (CORS or corporate proxy), point this at a server-side pass-through that
# forwards the ADQL `query` and `format` parameters to
# https://exoplanetarchive.ipac.caltech.edu/TAP/sync and returns its JSON.
# The value is public (it ships in the bundle): never put credentials in it.
#
# VITE_EXOPLANET_PROXY=https://your-proxy.example.com/tap
